# 统一换行符，避免 Windows/macOS 之间出现 CRLF 差异导致 CI 构建异常
* text=auto eol=lf

# PowerShell 脚本：保持 LF 即可（文件本身带 UTF-8 BOM，Windows PowerShell 5.1 才能正确解析中文）
*.ps1 text eol=lf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.zip binary
*.ipa binary
*.xcuserstate binary
